  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "type": "text",
    "text": "As my father walked into the room, my brother c $ \\underline{\\text{owered}} $ slightly (轻微地畏缩). He sensed that he had done something  $ \\underline{37} $ .I could see that he had  $ \\underline{38} $ my father's new hymnal and scribbled (乱涂) in it. Now he was waiting for his punishment.",
